{"id":"mx9bcz0zkdgh3qwpf1gwysydc","title":"火星神秘气体泄漏揭示潜在火山活动","originalTitle":"Mysterious gas leaks suggest Mars may still be volcanically alive","summary":"研究人员在火星巨大火山区域阿尔巴蒙斯发现异常的氯化氢气体浓度，表明火星内部可能仍有活跃的火山系统。欧洲航天局的ExoMars轨道飞行器首次在2021年检测到火星大气中的氯化氢。科学家推测这些气体可能源自地下热熔岩，这表明火星可能仍保留着足够的内部热量支持火山活动。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 综合"},"links":{"original":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/11/261106174525.htm"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T01:09:55.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:30.997Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T01:09:55.000Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":46,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}